    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 85b2d478e435e026ae71ca583cde91e1ced40330 -->\n**Delta review (M3): ready for the maintainer to merge.** Re-checked from 5daf3ebb to 85b2d478.\n- **The requested item is done:** `machines.md` gives each kind (mill, lathe, mill-turn, plasma) a \"Common refusals:\" paragraph, and states the EDM status at lines 122-131: Wire Contour can be created and generated, posting is refused, and sinker admits no operation yet. `Fixes #1261` stands.\n- **The #1265 sentence** now says a post that doesn't serve the kind is refused by name. #1265 is on main.\n- **All 17 quoted refusal fragments exist** in the app and post crates on main.\n- **Trial merge with main:** clean. `zola build` and `zola check --skip-external-links` pass.\n- **Docs only.**\n- **Labels:** `needs-rework` is left for the maintainer to clear.\n",
